      "markdown": "## Let's Spell\n\n## A Listen, point and repeat\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_319_678_785_1181.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"14%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1094_626_1530_1175.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"13%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1778_660_2211_1167.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"13%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_2488_660_2880_1171.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"11%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_429_1380_691_1760.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"7%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1109_1286_1422_1744.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"9%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1757_1183_2148_1739.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"11%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_2421_1209_2941_1743.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"15%\" /></div>\n\n\n### B Read aloud. Then listen and check\n\nking\n\nwing\n\ngoing\n\nstrong\n\nwrong\n\n## Listen and write\n\n1. I like _____ _____.\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1785_2252_2391_2721.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"18%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_369_2772_1064_3102.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"21%\" /></div>\n\n\n2. The bird has _____ _____.\n\n3. ___ is easier than ___.\n\nFly!\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_2042_3015_2845_3364.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"24%\" /></div>\n\n\n## D Listen and repeat\n\nMy mother likes singing,\n\nSinging happy songs.\n\nMy father likes reading,\n\nReading books all day long.\n\nBut I like running\n\nAnd playing ping-pong!\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1714_3518_2919_4312.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"36%\" /></div>\n",
